WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:05.346
Deal Alerts emails each owner about late deals, and gives their managers a summary.

00:00:05.346 --> 00:00:09.326
Start with “Past-due deals”, or create your own rule.

00:00:09.326 --> 00:00:14.107
“Preview” shows who would get what today, before anything is sent.

00:00:14.107 --> 00:00:16.327
“Get started” lists each step in order,

00:00:16.327 --> 00:00:19.607
from checking email sending to your first test.

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:22.374
Send yourself a test, then turn it on.

00:00:22.674 --> 00:00:25.334
It stays off until you do.
